  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Among the Trees of Amber
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Among the Trees of Amber
  content: 'Amberwood Forest rests beneath a vast forest whose golden canopy has
    inspired countless songs and legends. Herbalists gather rare medicinal plants
    beneath its shade, while skilled woodworkers shape timber into works admired
    throughout the realm. The forest itself is treated with quiet reverence. Hunters
    give thanks before entering its depths, and children are taught never to take
    more than they need. Whether these customs arose from wisdom or superstition
    is a matter of debate, yet they endure all the same.


    To walk the woodland
    paths is to understand why so many choose to remain, even after seeing the wider
    world.'
